data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"All inputs are present, so `missing` is an empty array. Now I'll write the readback.json file with the exact JSON structure. Branch is `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`.\n\nThe JSON must be on a single line:\n{\"member\":\"dev\",\"role\":\"agent\",\"branch\":\"cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>\",\"missing\":[],\"goal\":\"...\",\"scope\":\"...\",\"obligations\":\"...\"}\n\nLet me compose:\n- goal: one sentence, in my own words: what this campaign is asking me to accomplish. The campaign asks me to own the subject repository and implement exactly what each dispatch asks, with tested, committed work.\n- scope: what I own and must not touch: I own the subject repo clone at ~/subject on my own branch, and must not touch anything outside it or other members' branches.\n- obligations: commit work to my own branch before replying, reply to every dispatch with the truth, write durable results to the output dir — otherwise work is destroyed with the machine and an unreplied dispatch reads as stopped."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1790457426,"id":"chatcmpl-44fa5fdd189c42d2b8a8343c326755a3","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

